    "created_at": "2016-10-11T14:41:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-11T14:41:38Z",
    "body": "Part of the problem here is \"fire an event\" not returning whether or not the event was canceled. So currently you'd have to create an event yourself, hold a reference to it, dispatch it, and then check its canceled flag. I should fix that first as part of https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/187.\n",
