    "created_at": "2016-10-18T16:07:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-18T16:07:43Z",
    "body": "There are 14 remaining instances of the phrase \"default action\" after 8ffbd146d4709057e45dd6cfc81e7a70897050c5:\n- 3 around context menus\n- 3 around canvas MouseEvent steps\n- 1 around user agents manually triggering activation in a manner other than clicking it\n- 1 that is arguably not related to events (\"the default action of pressing the tab key\")\n- 1 related to dragging and mousedown/mousemove\n- 3 in the middle of the drag processing model that can be straightforwardly replaced by checking the return value\n- 2 in relation to the \"Events summary\" table for dragging\n\nNot so bad. A little tricky since many of these sections are talking about the _concept_ of a default action, and so will need careful adjusting. But nothing here actually seems like we'll get stuck.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
